KG42.register("clusters-8380a13c60b6361e6511e9c8",{"id":"32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v142-d-K001","paper":"32-wholesale_prosumer_storage","label":"Community participation permission, P2P product sources, and internal aggregate balance","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Community participation permission, P2P product sources, and internal aggregate balance","market_meaning":"In scenarios where P2P trading is permitted, the community opens direct trading to consumers and prosumers, limits energy sources according to the P2P or STEP scenario, and constrains the community-internal total sold and purchased quantities by the existing symbolic loss balance. The collective wholesale participation clause of R004 is retained as a cross-market trading interface.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM","LEM_DEM"],"process_stages":["participation","bidding","clearing","activation"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"Both P2P and STEP permit direct trading, but only STEP also includes energy storage; the DG source restriction in the P2P scenario cannot be extended into a unified source restriction for STEP. R009 shares only the scenario permissions, internal balance, and loss explanation, and its wholesale execution content therefore does not become a new obligation of this cluster. The candidate is limited to participation permission, product scope, and symbolic community aggregate balance.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The participating entities, tradable products, and community-internal balance jointly define a P2P trading rule with independent significance. According to the current C, R006-C002 is retained as a product-scope condition and is complementary to the mathematical balance of R001; it is not merged into a duplicate constraint. The wholesale access clause in R004 is used separately in K002 as a shared interface.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the participation permission for consumers in the P2P-enabled scenario."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the direct-trading permission for prosumers; retains the collective wholesale access clause of the same chain and shares a reference to that clause in K002."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Distinguishes the product sources and community-internal trading scope of P2P and STEP."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the symbolic loss balance for the community aggregate P2P sold and purchased quantities."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Cites only the scenario permissions of C003 to C006, Eq. (9) of C011, and the loss explanation of C012; Eq. (9) is an alternative expression and is not counted as an additional independent rule."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e38"],"rationale":"The source lists consumers and prosumers as participating entities in the same community P2P trading; the two permissions cover different entities and do not substitute for each other."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e38","v141-b-g03-E07"],"rationale":"The direct-trading permission is supplemented by scenario-specific product source conditions; the DG restriction of P2P and the condition that STEP permits locally produced and stored energy are retained separately."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L03","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"The product clause restricts trading to remain within the community, and Eq. (9) provides the corresponding community aggregate balance; this is a complementarity between scope and quantity constraints, not the same expression."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L04","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C011"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"Both chains record the same Eq. (9), attributed respectively to clearing and execution functions; both bindings are retained and are not accumulated as two balance obligations."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-L05","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C003","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C004","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C005","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C006"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e38","v141-b-g03-E07"],"rationale":"The P2P enabling conditions of the four scenarios define when the product permission applies; the disabling conditions of Base and BAT are not mixed with the permissions of P2P and STEP."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-M01","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X","v141-c-R009::x::v141-c-R009-x01"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"Both records refer to the aggregate P2P sold electricity indexed by household, time step, and scenario in the same model, and are used in Eq. (9); the local roles of clearing and execution are retained."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-M02","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-I","v141-c-R009::x::v141-c-R009-x02"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e23","v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"Both records refer to the household aggregate P2P purchased electricity that is aggregated in Eq. (8) and used in Eq. (9); their identity is associated, but the variables of each chain are not rewritten."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-M03","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-psi","v141-c-R009::theta::v141-c-R009-theta01"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e22","v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"Both records are the P2P efficiency factor used by the same Eq. (9); their symbolic parameter identity is associated, without supplying a numerical value or eliminating the original field differences."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-M04","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C011"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e24"],"rationale":"Both have the same community, time step, scenario, and P2P scope of application, and both transcribe Eq. (9). Only R001 is selected for expression display, while the execution-side constraints and all original bindings remain accessible."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G01","category":"unverified_source","description":"All evidence in this cluster remains unverified; candidate support eligibility does not mean that the B transcription or downstream scientific content has passed independent review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R004","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e02","v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e22","v141-b-g02-e23","v141-b-g02-e24","v141-b-g02-e38","v141-b-g03-E07"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Subsequent scientific confirmation requires independent checking of the original text, transcription, and scenario scope; this round retains the unaudited status for manual inspection."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G02","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The source uses both the efficiency factor and the statement of 7.6% loss, without clarifying the numerical multiplier actually adopted in Eq. (9); this cluster completes only assembly at the symbolic level.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-psi","v141-c-R009::theta::v141-c-R009-theta01"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e21","v141-b-g02-e22","v141-b-g02-e24"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Check the source definitions and implementation of efficiency and loss; 7.6% or its complement must not be assigned as the parameter value independently."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G03","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The existing C2 revision request for R006 still awaits confirmation of whether C002 is intended as a product-scope condition. This cluster adopts the current C's complementary interpretation and does not identify it as a duplicate expression of Eq. (9).","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R001"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e19","v141-b-g02-e24"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"The upstream should confirm the attribution of product scope and clearing balance; if formalization or bindings need to be changed, C should first be revised, and D does not copy formulas or add graph objects."}]},"rule_refs":["32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R003","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R004","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R006","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R001","32-wholesale_prosumer_storage::v141-c-R009"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-374de966ac2aa057","COMP-38f1b9199b3ea8cd","COMP-3fcd5e2d02ec7c3f","COMP-8194bc76303bef38","COMP-970463b73869ba14","COMP-a774da994c2ca212","COMP-b3f649e90c1f17b9"]});
